# orion monorepo (lodge-orion + orion-self).
# Other lone-lodge projects live in sibling dirs with their own repos.

# === Sibling projects (their own repos) ===
astra/
atlas/
skriva/
veil/

# === Build artifacts ===
**/target/
**/dist/
**/node_modules/
**/.cargo/
**/.rustup/

# === Generated files ===
*.exe
*.dll
*.obj
*.ll
*.pdb
*.lib
*.exp

# === IDE / OS ===
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# === Scratch / temp ===
scratchpad/
*.log
nul

# === Lock files we don't track (regenerate from manifests) ===
Cargo.lock
